  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your innate magic stems from the forces of chaos that underlie the order of creation, and in an eladrin it wears the face of the seasons. This is a house-rule variant of Wild Magic Sorcery built around a magical damper, the Containment Ring.</p>\n<p><strong>House rule:</strong> the level 3 feature of Wild Magic Sorcery is split. The risk half arrives at level 1, the reward half at level 3.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Level 1:</strong> Wild Magic Surge, Containment Ring, Surge Reroll, Fey Step (Season Rider), Prestidigitation on Autopilot</li>\n<li><strong>Level 3:</strong> Tides of Chaos</li></ul>\n<p><em>Uses the Lilians Wild Magic (d100) table, whose entries are in German on purpose because they are read aloud at the table.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
